00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:50.480
Yeah, it's kind of a similar idea.

88
00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:57.920
So Anscombe's quartet, like the idea that a data set could have like the same summary statistics, but visually be in very different shapes.

89
00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:01.480
The data source doesn't is just kind of another variation of this, but I don't know.

